# ML² chatbot — local-only OpenAI key.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste a key to get real model replies on
# `npm run dev`. WITHOUT a key the chatbot runs in "pretend" mode (canned
# answers) — which is also what the deployed site does, on purpose: a key
# baked into a static bundle is readable by anyone who opens the page.
#
# For real replies in production, stand up a tiny serverless proxy (Cloudflare
# Worker / Vercel function) that holds the key server-side and have the widget
# call that instead. Never put the key in this repo or in CI build env.
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=
